365
00:24:51,740 --> 00:24:54,951
Yes, sir. Team 1 has identified him.

366
00:24:54,952 --> 00:24:57,079
His name is Hwang Jongsu.

367
00:25:00,541 --> 00:25:02,668
Right, okay.

368
00:25:03,585 --> 00:25:05,670
FINGERPRINT SEARCH RESULTS
NAME, HWANG JONGSU

369
00:25:05,671 --> 00:25:06,880
