372
00:25:20,310 --> 00:25:22,021
<i>We have a suspect now.</i>

373
00:25:22,730 --> 00:25:24,440
<i>His name is Hwang Jongsu.</i>

374
00:25:25,357 --> 00:25:26,816
<i>He has a criminal record.</i>

375
00:25:26,817 --> 00:25:28,985
[♪ tense, suspenseful music continues]

376
00:25:28,986 --> 00:25:29,987
