385
00:26:14,323 --> 00:26:15,491
[Mr. Hwang clears throat]

386
00:26:16,575 --> 00:26:17,743
[gulps] Yes.

387
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:22,288
I heard you owe my dad big time.

388
00:26:22,289 --> 00:26:23,332
Yes.

389
00:26:24,583 --> 00:26:26,167
He saved my life.

390
00:26:26,168 --> 00:26:27,377
[Seongwon] Mmm.

391
00:26:29,129 --> 00:26:30,964
