393
00:26:35,094 --> 00:26:37,638
Yes, that's right.

394
00:26:38,347 --> 00:26:39,430
Now's that time.

395
00:26:39,431 --> 00:26:41,100
[♪ tense, ominous music playing]

396
00:26:42,017 --> 00:26:44,311
[chuckling smugly]

397
00:26:45,437 --> 00:26:47,481
Time to repay what you owe.

398
00:26:48,565 --> 00:26:49,733
[Mr. Hwang sighs softly]

399
00:26:52,903 --> 00:26:54,530
[Seongwon exhales deeply]

400
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:57,157
Run for your life.

401
00:26:59,034 --> 00:27:00,160
Make sure...

402
00:27:02,913 --> 00:27:04,248
