406
00:27:23,350 --> 00:27:24,977
- [engine revs]
- [tires screech]

407
00:27:27,563 --> 00:27:28,980
Hey, turn the car around.

408
00:27:28,981 --> 00:27:30,065
Hwang Jongsu.

409
00:27:30,649 --> 00:27:32,066
[tires screeching]

410
00:27:32,067 --> 00:27:33,776
[♪ gripping instrumental music playing]

411
00:27:33,777 --> 00:27:35,320
[tires screeching]

412
00:27:36,989 --> 00:27:38,282
[siren continues blaring]

413
00:27:39,658 --> 00:27:40,784
[tires screech]

414
00:27:43,453 --> 00:27:44,663
[engine revving]

415
00:27:49,334 --> 00:27:50,502
[tires screech]

416
00:28:03,015 --> 00:28:04,224
- [engine revving]
- [tires screech]

417
00:28:07,895 --> 00:28:10,062
Hwang Jongsu, stop the car!

418
00:28:10,063 --> 00:28:12,648
Mr. Hwang! Stop the car!

419
00:28:12,649 --> 00:28:15,319
Hwang Jongsu, stop the car!

420
00:28:15,736 --> 00:28:17,194
- [tires screech]
- [metallic crunch]

421
00:28:17,195 --> 00:28:19,406
- [Isoo grunts]
- [tires screeching]

422
00:28:20,741 --> 00:28:22,325
- [all grunt]
- [Isoo panting]

423
00:28:22,326 --> 00:28:24,328
- [engine revving]
- [tires screeching]

424
00:28:24,786 --> 00:28:26,078
[Hyera breathing heavily]

425
00:28:26,079 --> 00:28:27,580
- Follow him.
- [Kyungjin] Yes, ma'am.

426
00:28:27,581 --> 00:28:29,206
[siren continues blaring]

427
00:28:29,207 --> 00:28:30,666
[tires screeching]

428
00:28:30,667 --> 00:28:32,628
[♪ pulsating foreboding music playing]

429
00:28:49,394 --> 00:28:51,479
[panting frantically]

430
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:52,813
[siren wailing distantly]

431
00:28:52,814 --> 00:28:54,106
[siren approaches]

432
00:28:54,107 --> 00:28:55,192
[siren blaring]

433
00:28:58,904 --> 00:28:59,947
[siren stops]

434
00:29:03,992 --> 00:29:05,076
[♪ music fades]

435
00:29:05,077 --> 00:29:06,535
He's not here.

436
00:29:06,536 --> 00:29:08,497
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

437
00:29:11,375 --> 00:29:13,042
- That way.
- Right.

438
00:29:13,043 --> 00:29:14,503
[♪ music increases in tempo]

439
00:29:19,132 --> 00:29:20,384
[panting]

440
00:29:22,302 --> 00:29:23,844
[♪ music resumes tempo]

441
00:29:23,845 --> 00:29:25,764
[wheezing, panting]

442
00:29:30,352 --> 00:29:31,728
[cell phone vibrating]

443
00:29:38,151 --> 00:29:40,319
[Mr. Hwang, panting] <i>Ma'am, it's me.</i>

444
00:29:40,320 --> 00:29:41,321
Where are you?

445
00:29:42,114 --> 00:29:44,031
The Myeongun-dong construction site.

446
00:29:44,032 --> 00:29:45,158
[Taeseon] <i>That's not far.</i>

447
00:29:45,742 --> 00:29:47,535
<i>- Wait there.</i>
- Yes, ma'am.

448
00:29:47,536 --> 00:29:49,496
[♪ pulsating foreboding music playing]

449
00:29:54,459 --> 00:29:55,544
[beeps]

450
00:29:56,795 --> 00:29:57,879
[line ringing]

451
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:02,134
[♪ music increases in tempo]

452
00:30:06,304 --> 00:30:07,305
[Mr. Hwang grunts softly]

453
00:30:09,182 --> 00:30:11,101
[breath trembling, breathing heavily]

454
00:30:14,521 --> 00:30:15,604
Mr. Hwang!

455
00:30:15,605 --> 00:30:17,441
[♪ suspenseful, foreboding music playing]

456
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:23,447
[chuckles]

457
00:30:24,573 --> 00:30:25,699
Young Master.

458
00:30:26,283 --> 00:30:27,658
