461
00:30:31,705 --> 00:30:32,872
Please go ahead.

462
00:30:32,873 --> 00:30:34,207
[Mr. Hwang exhales softly]

463
00:30:41,214 --> 00:30:44,425
We got a suicidal person.
Myeongun-dong construction site. Hurry.

464
00:30:44,426 --> 00:30:45,594
[line disconnects]

465
00:30:46,178 --> 00:30:47,179
We're not here

466
00:30:49,097 --> 00:30:50,724
