499
00:32:34,035 --> 00:32:36,120
- [Junyoung] Cameras down!
- [Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

500
00:32:36,121 --> 00:32:37,496
- Stop filming.
- [Junyoung] No filming.

501
00:32:37,497 --> 00:32:39,916
- Cameras down!
- [Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

502
00:32:40,458 --> 00:32:42,335
