507
00:33:09,237 --> 00:33:10,404
- Stop filming.
- [heavy thud, squelch]

508
00:33:10,405 --> 00:33:12,114
- [reporters gasps]
- [reporter 1] What's that?

509
00:33:12,115 --> 00:33:13,657
[♪ somber music playing]

510
00:33:13,658 --> 00:33:15,201
- [swears softly]
- [camera shutters clicking]

511
00:33:15,202 --> 00:33:16,369
[frantic clamoring]

512
00:33:18,330 --> 00:33:19,830
[Kyungjin] Stop filming!

513
00:33:19,831 --> 00:33:21,999
No filming! Your cameras!

514
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:24,043
Turn off your cameras!
You can't film this!

515
00:33:24,044 --> 00:33:25,920
Turn off your cameras!

516
00:33:25,921 --> 00:33:27,504
- [reporter 2] Why?
- Stop filming!

517
00:33:27,505 --> 00:33:29,173
- Stop filming!
- Hello? I'm at...

518
00:33:29,174 --> 00:33:30,716
The suicidal person just...

519
00:33:30,717 --> 00:33:33,302
Yes, Myeongun-dong.
Please could you hurry?

520
00:33:33,303 --> 00:33:34,595
[Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

521
00:33:34,596 --> 00:33:37,097
You can't film this.
Turn off your cameras!

522
00:33:37,098 --> 00:33:38,934
- Turn off your cameras!
- [breath trembling]

523
00:33:39,851 --> 00:33:41,936
[Kyungjin] <i>Lower your cameras!
Stop filming!</i>

